@startuml tui-blame-state
title TUI Blame (T29) -- toggle & popup lifecycle

[*] --> Off

state Off {
}

state On {
  state "Lane rendered\n(labels or blanks)" as Lane
  [*] --> Lane
}

Off --> On : ToggleBlameAnnotations\n(blame_for + annotations_from_blame)
On --> Off : ToggleBlameAnnotations\n(blame = None, columns reclaimed)

On --> On : Save (success) / Reload from disk\n[refresh_blame_if_on]

state "Commit Details popup" as Popup {
  state "Fetch GitPanel::commit_detail\n(sanitize + truncate, every render)" as Fetch
  [*] --> Fetch
}

Lane --> Popup : click inside lane columns\non an annotated line\n(handle_mouse_click)
Lane --> Popup : ShowBlameForCurrentLine\n(caret's line has an annotation)
Popup --> On : Esc / any key

@enduml
